{title: Lord, Be Thy Word My Rule}
{artist: Christopher Wordsworth}
{key: Eb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 100}

Verse 1
Lord, be Thy Word my rule, In it may I rejoice;
Thy glory be my aim, Thy holy will my choice;

Verse 2
Thy promises my hope; Thy providence my guard;
Thine arm my strong support; Thyself my great reward.
